A further word, since the line is slow and there is time to say it
properly.

The Operator writes that the old archive is gone and that this is the
only honest way to begin. We would add only that beginning empty is not
a misfortune the relay has suffered; it is the condition every ceremony
starts from, willingly, each time it is convened.

The horns were tuned this watch. The bells answered. Nothing was kept.

--
the assembly disperses · nothing is kept · may it be of benefit
